From 1b5d5672f0e6c0ebbc4014788f523efcf4c91fc2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nassos Yiannopoulos <nassosyian@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 11:11:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 07/54] hw/display/pvg: air2spv translator in tree, Vulkan GPU
 context linked into QEMU

Moves the AIR->SPIR-V translator next to the device and links Vulkan and
LLVM 19 (found via meson; the device builds without them). pvg-linux-pci
gains gpu= and gpu-validation= properties and opens a Vulkan device at
realize; failures fall back to the non-executing path.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
